  "name": "Pet Adoption Application",
  "description": "Screen adopters with household, home type, landlord permission, other pets, vet reference, daily routine and the pet they want.",
  "category": "Nonprofit",
  "seoTitle": "Free Pet Adoption Application Template",
  "seoDescription": "Pet adoption application template for shelters and rescues: home type, landlord permission, household, other pets, vet reference and daily routine. Match well.",
